  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A 4.0 cm length of a conducting wire carries a current of 2.5 A. The length is parallel to another long straight wire that carries a current of 10 A. The distance between the wires is 1.0 cm. The currents are in opposite directions.</p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the force and the direction of the force acting on the 4.0 cm length?</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td><p>Magnitude of force / μN</p></td><td><p>Direction of force</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"A\"><td><p>A.</p></td><td><p>1.3</p></td><td><p>Towards other wire</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td><p>B.</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>Towards other wire</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td><p>C.</p></td><td><p>1.3</p></td><td><p>Away from other wire</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td><p>D.</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>Away from other wire</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>[1]</p>"
  },
